1	# Arrakis MCP Server
2	
3	A Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes [Arrakis](https://github.com/abshkbh/arrakis) VM sandbox functionality to Large Language Models.
4	
5	## Setup
6	
7	### Setup
8	
9	1. Clone this repository:
10	   ```bash
11	   git clone https://github.com/abshkbh/arrakis-mcp-server.git
12	   cd arrakis-mcp-server
13	   ```
14	
15	2. Configure your LLM tool to use the Arrakis MCP server by adding the following to your MCP configuration:
16	
17	   ```json
18	   "mcpServers": {
19	       "arrakis": {
20	           "command": "<path-to-uv>",
21	           "args": [
22	               "--directory",
23	               "<path-to-repo>",
24	               "run",
25	               "arrakis_mcp_server.py"
26	           ]
27	       }
28	   }
29	   ```
30	
31	## API
32	
33	The Arrakis MCP Server exposes the following MCP resources and tools:
34	
35	### Resources
36	
37	- `arrakis://vms` - List all available VMs
38	- `arrakis://vm/{vm_name}` - Get information about a specific VM
39	
40	### Tools
41	
42	- `start_sandbox` - Start a new VM sandbox
43	- `restore_snapshot` - Restore a VM from a snapshot
44	- `snapshot` - Create a snapshot of a VM
45	- `run_command` - Run a command in a VM
46	- `upload_file` - Upload a file to a VM
47	- `download_file` - Download a file from a VM
48	- `destroy_vm` - Destroy a specific VM
49	- `destroy_all_vms` - Destroy all VMs
50	- `update_vm_state` - Update the state of a VM (pause/stop)
51	
52	## License
53	
54	This project is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 - see the [LICENSE](LICENSE) file for details.
55	

